WEBVTT

00:23:00.038 --> 00:23:01.621
It can do that from English to French.

00:23:01.829 --> 00:23:04.204
Again, we never told it to
learn about translation.

00:23:04.204 --> 00:23:08.288
We never told it about the concepts of
English and French, but it learned them,

00:23:08.996 --> 00:23:11.454
even though we never said this is what
English is and this is what French is

00:23:11.496 --> 00:23:14.371
and this is what it means to translate,
it can still do it.

00:23:15.538 --> 00:23:18.079
Wow, I mean, for creative people,

00:23:18.704 --> 00:23:21.371
is there a world coming where the sort of

00:23:21.371 --> 00:23:26.204
the palette of possibility that they
can be exposed to is just explodes?

00:23:26.204 --> 00:23:27.413
I mean, if you're a musician,

00:23:27.954 --> 00:23:32.204
is there a near future where you can say
to your eye, OK, I'm going to bed now,